# Great Divide Guide: "Each land and Ally you control has '{T}: Add one mana of any color.'" On turn 5 Bot1's Plains, its Forest, its
# Momo (a Lemur Bat Ally) and the Guide itself (an Ally, no longer summoning sick) each tap for {R}, a color none of them makes by
# itself, in the same main phase: four red mana in the pool. The Ornithopter, which is neither a land nor an Ally, is the control that
# offers nothing to activate.

